Usage:
  codebase-memory-mcp cli get_graph_schema --flag value [--flag2 value2 ...]
  codebase-memory-mcp cli get_graph_schema --args-file <path-to-json>
  echo '<json>' | codebase-memory-mcp cli get_graph_schema
  codebase-memory-mcp cli get_graph_schema '<raw-json-args>'

Flags:
  --project <string> [required]
  --format <tree|json> [default: tree]
  --diagnostics <none|full> [default: none]
  --limit <integer> [default: 50]
  --offset <integer> [default: 0]
